    Types, or with the same Type but different Attributes; Special Summon both, also
    until the end of the next turn, this card and the Special Summoned monsters cannot
    be used as material for a Fusion, Synchro, Xyz, or Link Summon. You can only
    use this effect of "Charmer Quartet in Bloom" once per turn.'
